Description: Extrae instrumentation framework for parallel applications (intel + mvapich2, OpenHPC)
 Extrae is the core instrumentation package developed by the Performance
 Tools team at BSC. It generates Paraver trace files that can be analyzed
 with Paraver.
 Built with the intel compiler family and mvapich2 MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
